WEBVTT

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.090
NOGI PUBLICATIONS
NOGI GROUP

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.430
<i>Hey, did you hear that</i>
<i>Mr. Yamashita is taking a vacation?</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.430
-And for ten days in a row.
-Seriously?

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.560
<i>I heard he's working on a secret mission</i>
<i>and accompanying the chairman.</i>

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.690
<i>So cool! I didn't know</i>
<i>he was such a great businessman.</i>

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.190
REQUEST FOR ANNUAL LEAVE

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.190
HIROSHI MATSUI
NOGI PUBLICATIONS, NOGI GROUP

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.190
<i>How, how could you, Yamashita?</i>

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.070
<i>And so...</i>

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.580
I'll be away on a business trip
for ten days.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.040
KAZUO YAMASHITA
PRESIDENT, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.210
I've left you some money
on the dining table.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.500
Call me if you need my help.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.580
KENZO YAMASHITA, KAZUO'S OLDEST SON
AND THE REAL PRESIDENT OF UNDER MOUNT INC

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.300
I'm off. Take care, Kenzo.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:55.590
The Life-or-Death Tournament
is finally about to start.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:00.970
Let the battle to become
ruler of the nation commence.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:04.140
<i>Today is the first day of</i>
<i>the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament.</i>

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.730
DAY ONE
KENGAN LIFE-OR-DEATH TOURNAMENT

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.200
So many people!

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:09.750
One hundred and fifty-one fighters...

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.730
KAEDE AKIYAMA,
CHAIRMAN'S SECRETARY, NOGI GROUP

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:12.680
...have entered.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.430
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.820
All fighting for the top spot.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.240
HIDEKI NOGI
CHAIRMAN, NOGI GROUP

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.240
SEN HATSUMI
FIGHTER

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.990
Thank you for waiting.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.050
It's time for boarding.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.000
THE GUARDS, PRIVATE ARMY OF METSUDO
KATAHARA, GOVERNOR OF DAINIPPON BANK

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:30.380
Those with invitations are welcome...

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:31.670
THE KENGAN, CRUISE SHIP

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.460
...to board the Kengan cruise ship.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:37.010
Look at how gorgeous it is!

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:40.140
It's one of the biggest
luxury cruise ships in the world.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.850
GEN SHIKANO,
JUN SEKIBAYASHI

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:42.970
A ship? Never tried one.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.180
SHION SORYUIN,
SETSUNA KIRYU

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.060
But, um...

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:51.650
Excuse me, but we don't
have a letter of invitation.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:56.700
If you don't have an invitation,
please board the other ship.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:01:59.200
Seriously?

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.450
THE DEATH
CARGO SHIP

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.950
-That worn-out ship is for us?
-What are they thinking?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.750
THE DEATH

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.920
<i>I will definitely get seasick on it.</i>

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:43.970
"BRAWL"

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.180
<i>Jeez!</i>

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.980
All I can say is "jeez."

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.480
I feel nervous,
being in a place like this.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.770
What's going to happen next?

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.780
I'm feeling rather relaxed here.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.860
Ladies and gentlemen,
thank you for waiting.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:05.990
We ask that the fighters go
through that door into the other room.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:13.000
Would the rest of you
please proceed upstairs?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:17.500
Does that mean we're going
to be separated from Ohma?

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.170
It seems so.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.170
See you, Kazuo Yamashita.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:25.430
-Wait! You're leaving us so soon?
-Let's go upstairs.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:39.320
Well, well... I can see
some fools in here

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.030
mistakenly believe themselves
to be the strongest.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:50.290
Wow, what a surprise! Look at that!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:53.460
Please, stop acting like a child,
Mr. Yamashita.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.210
Oh, there's Ohma! He's seen us!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.670
What? Something to drink?

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:06.970
Okay, okay. I have his bag here.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.890
If it's just a drink, I'll take it to him.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:13.480
-Don't forget, you're a president for now.
-"For now"?

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.940
-Please, try to be dignified.
-Yes.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:24.820
<i>Why are they keeping the employers</i>
<i>and the fighters in different rooms?</i>

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.080
-Thanks.
-Is there anything else?

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.500
Well, see you later.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.290
Wait, Kaede.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.880
What do you think about this situation?

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.800
What do you mean?

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:50.930
I mean exactly what I said.
Something is obviously off...

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.470
It's like some kind of special show.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:58.310
I can't wait to see
what's going to happen.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:01.690
Wait, don't tell me...

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:06.530
-The Death<i> has departed.</i>
-<i>All right, start it.</i>

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.950
What just happened?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:17.210
<i>Employers and fighters,</i>
<i>thank you for waiting.</i>

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.420
<i>Our ship has set sail, as planned.</i>

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.710
I'd also like to take this
opportunity to announce

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.880
that the preliminary match of
the Life-or-Death Tournament has begun.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.630
The preliminary match?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.470
-Do we have to do this?
-I didn't know that.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.930
<i>One hundred and fifty-one participants</i>
<i>have been entered into this tournament.</i>

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:41.560
<i>Twenty eight out of the 151 participants</i>
<i>have an invitation from Chairman Katahara,</i>

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.860
<i>and are seeded to fight in the finals.</i>

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.990
Those are the guys who
boarded the other ship.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.860
<i>Only five more participants</i>
<i>can make it to the finals.</i>

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:53.910
<i>We would like to challenge</i>
<i>everyone here to a battle royal.</i>

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.870
You have until dawn.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:01.830
Excuse me, I'm not supposed to be in here!
I'm not a fighter!

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:07.960
<i>From now on, you are prohibited from</i>
<i>contacting your fighter for any reason.</i>

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:13.220
<i>Please enjoy watching the battle royal</i>
<i>from the viewing area above the field.</i>

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:19.480
I can't believe this!
Ms. Akiyama is in danger!

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:24.480
<i>You can also enjoy a game on the deck</i>
<i>courtesy of our bookmaker.</i>

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:28.490
<i>Any of you who are confident about</i>
<i>the outcome are welcome to place a bet.</i>

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:32.990
I guess we'll be trapped in this room
until the preliminary match is over.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.200
That includes you.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:39.960
You have no choice.
Be careful not to get in my way.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:42.620
Are you an idiot?

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.710
-What the...
-Besides,

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.130
it's your fault that I'm trapped in here!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.630
Ohma, of course you are responsible!

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.680
You must win this, okay?

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.390
Protect me at all costs
until you win this battle.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:02.140
Well, you've got some guts.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:05.400
Hey, you brought a woman with you?
That's some nerve!

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:07.900
The match is already on!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.610
-Kaede Akiyama.
-Address me in a more polite manner.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.490
-Keep well back.
-Don't use my full name.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:16.870
-Laid-back, aren't you?
-I'll kill you!

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.960
NIKO STYLE - REDIRECTION KATA:
WEEPING WILLOW

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.210
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.590
<i>The flow of power is bent.</i>

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:30.800
Yes!

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.510
All right.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:36.050
-Keep behind me, Your Majesty.
-Sure.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.600
Did you see that?

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:40.220
He's pretty strong. Let's smash him first.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:43.140
It'll be harder for each of us
if he survives this round.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.690
Let's crush him as a group.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.560
Tokita!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.570
-Lihito.
-He entered the tournament too?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.990
LIHITO
FIGHTER, SH FROZEN STORAGE

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.120
-I've missed you, Tokita.
-That's Lihito.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.950
-Lihito the Ripper!
-Hey, Lihito.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.580
Don't say you've forgotten me.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.630
I'm going to get back
at you for this scar.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.090
Who are you, jerk? Go away.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.840
THE RAZOR'S EDGE, TEN RIPPING FINGERS

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:20.390
<i>He ripped close up.</i>
<i>He's become more skillful.</i>

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:23.520
I've longed to see you, Tokita.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:26.640
I've trained relentlessly
for this moment...

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.570
-You're Nogi Group's...
-Hi.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:34.650
What are you doing here? Um...

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:38.450
I'm Kaede Akiyama.
I didn't choose to be here.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:42.330
I brought water to Ohma, and now
here I am, having to endure all this.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.290
Are you listening?

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:48.670
-Do you have a boyfriend?
-I knew you weren't listening.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:53.210
Okay, I think I understand
your situation, Tokita.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.760
Look, they're targeting you too.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:10:00.680
Don't worry, baby. I'll be your bodyguard!

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.220
No, thank you.

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:05.270
She doesn't need you.
Can I get started?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.310
-Don't hold back for my sake.
-You wanted to beat me up, didn't you?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.190
Right. I'll get my revenge
on you, don't worry.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:18.950
But not now. I want you
to advance to the finals.

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:20.660
What do you mean?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:25.160
Stay back, Kaede.
There's going to be bloodshed.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.410
Listen to me.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.790
Don't screw around with us!

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.130
Guys! Let's kill these rats!

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.790
You can't do that.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.170
Never!

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:37.920
They're unrivaled.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.970
Those two are incredible.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.260
That's it! That's my Ohma!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.520
What's that?

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:48.430
Stay away!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.440
Who's that?

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.330
JERRY TYSON
FIGHTER, 22ND CENTURY FAX

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:10.040
Who's that weirdo?
Is he a fighter too, Kaede?

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:12.000
Maybe.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.210
I don't have much information
about the other fighters.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:19.720
I think we have a clown here.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.300
You're my next prey, right?

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.700
JERRY TYSON, 22ND CENTURY FAX
RECORD: 3 WINS, 0 LOSSES

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:48.750
TOTAL ASSETS ACQUIRED:
1 BILLION, 952 MILLION YEN

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.660
OHMA TOKITA, YAMASHITA CORP
RECORD: 3 WINS, 0 LOSSES

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.750
TOTAL ASSETS ACQUIRED:
15 BILLION, 414 MILLION YEN

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.710
Ohma.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.640
What is this trick?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.100
<i>He turned so quickly.</i>

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.850
That's no human move.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.940
I'm not going to stop, boy.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:15.480
Not anytime,

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.770
not ever.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:21.440
I'll keep chasing my enemies
until they're destroyed.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.240
That's my Xing Yi Quan.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:32.250
<i>Jerry Tyson, 32 years old.</i>
<i>He's from Detroit, USA.</i>

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:37.380
<i>At the age of 17, he moved to China</i>
<i>because of his father's business.</i>

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:42.340
<i>What he discovered in this new land was...</i>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.180
<i>Chinese kung fu.</i>

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.590
CHINESE KUNG FU

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:51.310
<i>Xing Yi Quan is one of its styles,</i>
<i>developed by mimicking or channeling</i>

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:55.270
<i>the forms and movements</i>
<i>of various animals.</i>

00:12:56.020 --> 00:13:00.070
<i>However, a question arose in Jerry's mind.</i>

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.650
<i>Why animals?</i>

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:08.740
<i>Why did he have to mimic animals</i>
<i>when they're weaker than human beings?</i>

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.040
<i>Then he realized something.</i>

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.500
<i>He should really mimic humans...</i>

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.550
<i>No, their... weapons.</i>

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.970
WEAPONS

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.090
<i>Seven years later,</i>

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:32.680
<i>he created J-style Xing Yi Quan,</i>
<i>mimicking modern weapons.</i>

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:36.440
<i>Its most powerful move is...</i>

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:39.270
Take this Scud Missile!

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.110
It's a powerful punch
which uses the entire mass of the body.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.610
Idiot! Your side is open--

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:51.450
You're the idiot.
My kung fu style has no dead zone.

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:56.790
Attacking me when I'm moving this fast

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:00.290
<i>is like running into a large truck.</i>

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:01.840
Just give up.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.050
Surrender yourself to my attack.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:13.180
SORYU FORM: WEEPING WILLOW

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.150
<i>He'll crash into the wall!</i>

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:22.070
<i>It's impossible to make</i>
<i>a sudden stop at this speed.</i>

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.190
<i>Just joking!</i>

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.900
<i>Did you think I'd let you</i>
<i>beat me that easily?</i>

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.660
I won't let you enjoy a victory
that's sweeter than Mom's apple pie.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.030
He repositioned himself!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:36.450
Using the wall,
I've now got even more speed!

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:41.210
I'm now like...
a full metal jacket bullet!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.710
<i>A girl? Why is a non-fighter here?</i>

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:49.430
<i>Adjust my course? Brake?</i>
<i>No time left!</i>

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.220
<i>Use your brain, Jerry!</i>

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:54.720
<i>Think what to do!</i>

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.930
<i>Make a decision now!</i>

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.400
<i>I can't.</i>

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.520
IMPOSSIBLE

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.980
<i>Sorry, girl.</i>

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:08.030
<i>You won't die at least,</i>
<i>so please forgive me.</i>

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.120
Oh?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.330
Jeez... you should have screamed.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:21.250
-Ohma!
-Saving you isn't rewarding.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.540
But I like a strong-minded woman.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.050
Please, don't joke around
in this situation.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.470
How...

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.180
How was I the one to get blown out?

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.060
You don't get it?

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:42.020
I don't like to use this technique
because it's not cool.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.400
Be careful.
Unlike the Redirection Kata,

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.480
<i>I can't control my power when doing this.</i>

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:52.530
TOKITA TOWN IN THE ILLEGAL ZONE OF JAPAN,
KNOWN AS "NAKA"

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:03.370
<i>You still don't understand, do you?</i>

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:07.210
<i>Darn! Why won't it go in?</i>

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.340
NIKO TOKITA,
OHMA'S MASTER OF NIKO STYLE

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.180
<i>As I said, there's no point trying that.</i>

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.800
<i>You'd better not use your bare hands.</i>

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.940
<i>Oh, boy. I told you not to.</i>

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:26.980
<i>All right, now I'll explain to you</i>
<i>why your fists got hurt,</i>

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.070
<i>in a scientific way.</i>

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:34.160
<i>Question. If you had a kilo</i>
<i>of tofu and a kilo of iron,</i>

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:38.280
<i>which would be more painful</i>
<i>if they hit you at the same speed?</i>

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.250
<i>-I'll kill you!</i>
<i>-Listen to me.</i>

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.880
<i>What I'm trying to tell you is that</i>
<i>the harder object will be more painful.</i>

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.250
<i>Watch carefully, okay?</i>

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.340
<i>At the moment of impact,</i>

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.010
<i>tense your muscles.</i>

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.730
<i>It's quite something, right?</i>

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:08.150
<i>Tense every one of your muscles</i>
<i>the moment before impact,</i>

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.110
<i>then smash your steel-like body</i>
<i>into the object.</i>

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.820
<i>It's Indestructible, the basic technique</i>
<i>in the Adamantine Kata of the Niko style.</i>

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.240
<i>So, are you interested</i>
<i>in learning the Niko style now?</i>

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.330
<i>Not at all!</i>

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.540
<i>What the hell, I'll borrow...</i>

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.800
<i>your Niko style.</i>

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:33.260
Are you going to challenge me head-on,

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.010
even when I'm heavier than you?

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.220
You're underestimating me.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.720
Miracles don't happen twice.

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:51.770
With this technique specialized in attack,
I make sure to destroy the enemy.

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:58.700
NIKO STYLE - ADAMANTINE KATA:
INDESTRUCTIBLE

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.830
<i>It's more than mimicking.</i>

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:08.710
<i>The boy himself is the weapon.</i>

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.960
He won! That's my Ohma!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:18.050
In some ways, you were quite strong.

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:20.600
Oh, I forgot to ask his name.

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.220
<i>Darn it!</i>

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.100
<i>Why can't I take him down?</i>

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:41.280
Damn you!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:47.500
<i>How can my submission hold be resisted</i>
<i>by a moron with only brute force?</i>

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.290
A piece of cake!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:56.380
Your primitive fighting style
hasn't changed.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:19:00.640
You're also in this match, Sawada?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.720
That's what I wanted to say.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:07.560
You're such a poor loser.
I'll finish you off.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:10.980
You're still such a big mouth.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.400
Just bring it on, queer!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.230
<i>Queer... queer...</i>

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.070
Don't...

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.410
Don't call me a queer, you brat!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:26.990
Hey, Lihito! Don't get smart with me,
or I'm pretty sure I'll kill you.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.540
Your hairstyle is disgusting, queer.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.670
How dare you call me disgusting,
you little shit!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.140
<i>Is that true?</i>

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.560
I'm quite certain, sir.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:51.390
<i>That's impossible. It's too soon.</i>

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:55.820
<i>The preliminary match</i>
<i>only started 15 minutes ago.</i>

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.980
So, you guys are the ones

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.240
who'll be the sideshow
to my main act in the finals.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.950
LIHITO
FIGHTER, SH FROZEN STORAGE

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.950
KEIZABURO SAWADA
FIGHTER, MURDER MUSIC

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.960
YOSHINARI KARO
FIGHTER, AJIRO FISHERIES

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.960
HASSARD
FIGHTER, BERCY PETROLEUM

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.710
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:24.220
I can't believe this.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.220
Shoot!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:31.140
I predicted all five
of them would qualify!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:34.230
Darn it! If I had placed a bet
I could've earned big.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:39.230
<i>It would have helped me pay off my debt.</i>

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:48.030
Ohma Tokita, my dear. I knew it.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.200
You'd never lose to those fools.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:53.410
I can't wait to kill you or
get lovingly killed by you.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.880
SETSUNA KIRYU
FIGHTER, KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.130
<i>Ohma, sweetie!</i>

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:02.590
Oh, dear.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:06.140
I feel the mood is too tense
for a ceremony.

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:08.890
Look!

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:11.970
Chairman Katahara is here!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.930
METSUDO KATAHARA, GOVERNOR OF DAINIPPON
BANK & KENGAN ASSOCIATION CHAIRMAN

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:15.900
Gentlemen!

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.650
Congratulations for making it through
the preliminary match.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:24.740
Or maybe I should say, commiserations
for not losing in the preliminary match.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:30.870
I originally planned to have a meeting
tomorrow morning, but...

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:34.660
Hmm... what's wrong?

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.290
Hassard.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.530
EISAKU SUZUKI
PRESIDENT, BERCY PETROLEUM

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:39.790
Hassard, don't.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:44.170
Mr. Katahara.
I have a question to ask you.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.800
Oh, my... he's so gorgeous!

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:51.390
Why did you impose the preliminary
match only on us?

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:54.350
I want a good explanation from you.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:59.230
What kind of factors were being considered
other than our abilities?

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:02.020
Don't flatter yourself, impudent brat!

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:04.360
What?

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:10.240
The top 28 in the company hierarchy
of the Kengan Association were exempted

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:14.410
from the first match because they
already have excellent results.

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:16.910
<i>The company hierarchy?</i>

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:22.750
We live in a world where merchants'
companies struggle for dominance.

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:28.010
It's hilarious that a tool like you
would argue over your merchant's head.

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:32.810
You should remember that
you fighters are just pawns.

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:35.720
Well, then I'll teach you...

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:38.140
how strong a pawn can be.

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:39.650
Hey, wait!

00:22:57.370 --> 00:22:58.290
Rats!

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:04.880
God, the blood...

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:18.140
-Thank you, Yodoe.
-Anytime.

00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:20.770
No, Hassard!

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:23.190
What was that?

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:25.150
He finished him in a flash.

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:28.610
<i>Metsudo Katahara's private army,</i>
<i>known as the Guards,</i>

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:31.990
<i>are his shield while Fang is his pike.</i>

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:36.540
<i>It's an army of monsters</i>
<i>with extraordinary strength.</i>

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:38.370
How silly!

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:41.960
He acted up without considering
his own ability.

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:46.300
Now the number of fighters is
down to 32 because of him.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.880
But an even number is good.

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:53.260
<i>Really?</i>

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:57.310
<i>What kind of monsters are going to</i>
<i>show up in the finals?</i>

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:04.940
<i>I have nothing but bad feelings</i>
<i>about this tournament.</i>

00:25:36.070 --> 00:25:36.950
PREVIEW

00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:39.700
<i>On </i>The Kengan<i>, a gorgeous ship,</i>

00:25:39.830 --> 00:25:42.910
<i>schemes, conspiracies</i>
<i>and everything else is possible.</i>

00:25:43.160 --> 00:25:44.290
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:25:44.500 --> 00:25:49.040
<i>A dark horse predicts the divine move.</i>
<i>Next episode: "Pulling Strings"</i>

00:25:49.130 --> 00:25:51.000
Subtitle translation by Hinako Someno
